Package: ccvv-linux
Version: @@VERSION@@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: ccvv maintainers <opensource@ccvv.invalid>
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1, libx11-6, libxfixes3, libwayland-client0, dbus-user-session | dbus
Description: Clipboard sanitizer daemon for Linux desktops
 ccvv-linux runs the ccvv clipboard sanitizer as a user-session daemon on
 Linux desktops, ships the ccvv-tray-sni sidecar, and installs XDG autostart
 plus optional systemd user assets.
